		"Text": "@,^^I deeply apologize. After much deliberation, I have finally decided to send this letter.^^I heard that you and Shane started dating. While I know I should express my best wishes, I simply can't bring myself to do so. How could you do this, @? How could you possibly fall for a person like that? I am willing to bet that you know far less about Shane than someone else here - like Emily. He's made such a mess of his own life. Surely you don't want to be his guardian forever? No offense, but you and he are in no way compatible. Though, naturally, he's the one who doesn't deserve you.^^I'm doing my best to control my tone, but I hope you understand that I am in no way calm at this time. I implore you to rethink this choice carefully. It's unbecoming of you to make such a rash decision.^^I have enclosed what you need. Once you're ready, give it to him. He will understand.^^-Your Faithful Admirer", 
		"WhichBG": 0, 
		"Repeatable": false, 
